<title>RUSSIA: Russian energy body expect cut in pipeline tariffs.</title>
<headline>Russian energy body expect cut in pipeline tariffs.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's Federal Energy Commission (FEC) expects oil and oil product pipeline tariffs to be cut by 20 percent in May, Pavel Serikov, head of the FEC's price regulation section said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect a reduction in May of around 20 percent (in oil and product transport tariffs),&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
